#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:907
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_OurNewHomeLetsGoInside"
msgid ""
"MOM: {PLAYER}, we're here, honey!\p"
"It must be tiring riding with our things\n"
"in the moving truck.\p"
"Well, this is LITTLEROOT TOWN.\p"
"How do you like it?\n"
"This is our new home!\p"
"It has a quaint feel, but it seems to be\n"
"an easy place to live, don't you think?\p"
"And, you get your own room, {PLAYER}!\n"
"Let's go inside.$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈：{PLAYER}，我们到了哦！\p"
"跟行李一起坐在搬家卡车里，\n"
"一定很累吧？\p"
"这里就是未白镇了。\p"
"你觉得怎么样？\n"
"这里就是我们的新家了！\p"
"虽然是个很朴素的小镇，\n"
"不过住起来应该很舒服，你说呢？\p"
"而且，{PLAYER}，你还有自己的\n"
"房间哦！我们进去吧。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:919
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_WaitPlayer"
msgid "MOM: Wait, {PLAYER}!$"
msgstr "妈妈：等一下，{PLAYER}！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:922
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_WearTheseRunningShoes"
msgid ""
"MOM: {PLAYER}! {PLAYER}! Did you\n"
"introduce yourself to PROF. BIRCH?\p"
"Oh! What an adorable POKéMON!\n"
"You got it from PROF. BIRCH. How nice!\p"
"You're your father's child, all right.\n"
"You look good together with POKéMON!\p"
"Here, honey! If you're going out on an\n"
"adventure, wear these RUNNING SHOES.\p"
"They'll put a zip in your step!$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈：{PLAYER}！{PLAYER}！你去跟\n"
"小田卷博士打过招呼了吗？\p"
"哎呀！好可爱的宝可梦！\n"
"是小田卷博士送你的吗？真好！\p"
"你果然是你爸爸的孩子呢。\n"
"跟宝可梦在一起真是太合适了！\p"
"来，给你！既然要出门去冒险，\n"
"就穿上这双跑步鞋吧。\p"
"穿上它，走路会变得很轻快哦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:933
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_SwitchShoesWithRunningShoes"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} switched shoes with the\n"
"RUNNING SHOES.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}换上了跑步鞋。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:937
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_ExplainRunningShoes"
msgid ""
"MOM: {PLAYER}, those shoes came with\n"
"instructions.\p"
"“Press the B Button while wearing these\n"
"RUNNING SHOES to run extra-fast!\p"
"“Slip on these RUNNING SHOES and race\n"
"in the great outdoors!”$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈：{PLAYER}，这双鞋附带了\n"
"说明书哦。\p"
"“穿着跑步鞋时按住B键，\n"
"就能飞快地奔跑！\p"
"“穿上跑步鞋，\n"
"在广阔的大自然中尽情奔跑吧！”$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:945
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_ComeHomeIfAnythingHappens"
msgid ""
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"To think that you have your very own\n"
"POKéMON now…\l"
"Your father will be overjoyed.\p"
"…But please be careful.\n"
"If anything happens, you can come home.\p"
"Go on, go get them, honey!$"
msgstr ""
"…… …… …… ……\n"
"…… …… …… ……\p"
"没想到你也有自己的宝可梦了……\n"
"你爸爸一定会非常高兴的。\p"
"……不过，一定要小心哦。\n"
"要是遇到什么事，随时都可以回家。\p"
"去吧，加油哦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:955
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_CanUsePCToStoreItems"
msgid ""
"If you use a PC, you can store items\n"
"and POKéMON.\p"
"The power of science is staggering!$"
msgstr ""
"只要使用电脑，就能保管\n"
"道具和宝可梦。\p"
"科学的力量真是太厉害了！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:960
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_BirchSpendsDaysInLab"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH spends days in his LAB\n"
"studying, then he'll suddenly go out in\l"
"the wild to do more research…\p"
"When does PROF. BIRCH spend time\n"
"at home?$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士总是一连好几天都待在\n"
"研究所里做研究，然后又会突然\l"
"跑到野外去做更多调查……\p"
"小田卷博士到底什么时候\n"
"才会待在家里呢？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:967
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_IfYouGoInGrassPokemonWillJumpOut"
msgid ""
"Um, um, um!\p"
"If you go outside and go in the grass,\n"
"wild POKéMON will jump out!$"
msgstr ""
"那个，那个，那个！\p"
"要是走到外面的草丛里，\n"
"就会有野生的宝可梦跳出来哦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:972
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_DangerousIfYouDontHavePokemon"
msgid ""
"It's dangerous if you don't have\n"
"your own POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"要是没有自己的宝可梦，\n"
"是很危险的哦。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:976
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_CanYouGoSeeWhatsHappening"
msgid ""
"Um, hi!\p"
"There are scary POKéMON outside!\n"
"I can hear their cries!\p"
"I want to go see what's going on,\n"
"but I don't have any POKéMON…\p"
"Can you go see what's happening\n"
"for me?$"
msgstr ""
"那个，你好！\p"
"外面有好可怕的宝可梦！\n"
"我听到它们的叫声了！\p"
"我想去看看发生了什么事，\n"
"可是我没有宝可梦……\p"
"你能帮我去看看\n"
"到底怎么了吗？$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:985
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_YouSavedBirch"
msgid ""
"You saved PROF. BIRCH!\n"
"I'm so glad!$"
msgstr ""
"你救了小田卷博士！\n"
"太好了！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:989
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_GoodLuckCatchingPokemon"
msgid ""
"Are you going to catch POKéMON?\n"
"Good luck!$"
msgstr ""
"你要去捉宝可梦吗？\n"
"加油哦！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:993
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_TownSign"
msgid ""
"LITTLEROOT TOWN\n"
"“A town that can't be shaded any hue.”$"
msgstr ""
"未白镇\n"
"“不会被染上任何颜色的小镇”$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:997
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_ProfBirchsLab"
msgid "PROF. BIRCH'S POKéMON LAB$"
msgstr "小田卷博士的宝可梦研究所$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:1000
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_PlayersHouse"
msgid "{PLAYER}'s HOUSE$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}的家$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:1003
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_ProfBirchsHouse"
msgid "PROF. BIRCH'S HOUSE$"
msgstr "小田卷博士的家$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown/scripts.inc:1006
msgctxt "LittlerootTown_Text_BirchSomethingToShowYouAtLab"
msgid ""
"PROF. BIRCH: Well, well, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"That was good work out there!\p"
"I knew there was something special\n"
"about you when I first saw you,\l"
"but I never expected this.\p"
"Oh, yes. Do you still have the POKéDEX\n"
"I gave you?\p"
"I have something to show you.\n"
"Let's go to my LAB.$"
msgstr ""
"小田卷博士：哎呀哎呀，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"你表现得真不错！\p"
"第一次见到你的时候，我就觉得\n"
"你很不一般，\l"
"但真没想到你这么厉害。\p"
"对了，我给你的宝可梦图鉴\n"
"还带在身上吗？\p"
"我有东西要给你看。\n"
"我们去研究所吧。$"
